{"2693880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RX10-40", "steam_appid": 2693880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/0be2c027c440f223f0b706445e6266f4.poster.avif?t=1786961115\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/0be2c027c440f223f0b706445e6266f4.webm?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/0be2c027c440f223f0b706445e6266f4.mp4?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RX10-40 is a third-person shooter set in an industrial zone emptied of people. On a high-speed battlefield with no vertical aim, gun down swarms of rampaging robots. Close in on whoever sent the invitation, and put an end to this festival no one cheers for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/b1fb47149f119403b688c65c19bd83bc.poster.avif?t=1786961115\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/b1fb47149f119403b688c65c19bd83bc.webm?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/b1fb47149f119403b688c65c19bd83bc.mp4?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An invitation addressed to humanity. But there is almost no one left to open it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, yes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Declining, it seems, is not one of the options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/5ed9855f1eed2877374b9d835ffb7f36.poster.avif?t=1786961115\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/5ed9855f1eed2877374b9d835ffb7f36.webm?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/5ed9855f1eed2877374b9d835ffb7f36.mp4?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horizontal-only reticle. You cannot aim up or down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat built around a gun, a stun baton, a shield and a dodge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Attacks, unleashed once your Action Points fill up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up instantly with every game over. Retry instantly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels and aim assist, so you can get through even if your aim isn't great.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/170d26ba23c89595b4b7c15e45b063d6.poster.avif?t=1786961115\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/170d26ba23c89595b4b7c15e45b063d6.webm?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/170d26ba23c89595b4b7c15e45b063d6.mp4?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity surrendered all labor to the machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then it vanished, never having found a use for the freedom it had won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an industrial zone no one ever returns to, the machines are working still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In time they multiplied, learned weapons, and then learned <strong>play</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>August 23, 2063.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An invitation arrives for the last of humankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— Pilot a robot. Join the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is called <strong>RX10-40</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/d2a60f905257527b55e6b794e16ecedd.poster.avif?t=1786961115\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/d2a60f905257527b55e6b794e16ecedd.webm?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/d2a60f905257527b55e6b794e16ecedd.mp4?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to stream this game and upload videos of it, monetized or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/0be2c027c440f223f0b706445e6266f4.poster.avif?t=1786961115\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared