akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/5ed9855f1eed2877374b9d835ffb7f36.mp4?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horizontal-only reticle. You cannot aim up or down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat built around a gun, a stun baton, a shield and a dodge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Attacks, unleashed once your Action Points fill up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up instantly with every game over. Retry instantly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels and aim assist, so you can get through even if your aim isn't great.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/170d26ba23c89595b4b7c15e45b063d6.poster.avif?t=1786961115\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/170d26ba23c89595b4b7c15e45b063d6.webm?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/170d26ba23c89595b4b7c15e45b063d6.mp4?t=1786961115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity surrendered all labor to the machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then it vanished, never having found a use for the freedom it had won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an industrial zone no one ever returns to, the machines are working still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In time they multiplied, learned weapons, and then learned <strong>play</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr